Sun Oct 18 09:21:16 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.8.0:
  * Bundled dear imgui updated to 1.92.9 and implot to 1.0
  * Added basic support for sRGB framebuffer usage
  * Use VSG CMake config for C++17 support, require vsg >= 1.1.13
  * Key handling fixes: drop special cases of key code handling,
    fix modifier key state sent to ImGui
  * Fix in-tree build warnings when building a library using vsgImGui
- Spec file cleanup: drop obsolete Group tags and %defattr

